<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Privacy Policy – SHINEX Learning Circle</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/css/all.min.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css">
    <style>
        /* ============================================================
           PRIVACY POLICY STYLES
           ============================================================ */
        
        .privacy-container {
            max-width: 900px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }
        
        /* ----- Page Header ----- */
        .privacy-header {
            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-lg);
        }
        
        .privacy-header h1 {
            font-size: 2rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: var(--text-primary);
            margin: 0 0 4px 0;
        }
        
        .privacy-header h1 i {
            color: var(--purple-primary);
        }
        
        .privacy-header .last-updated {
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            margin: 0;
        }
        
        .privacy-header .last-updated strong {
            color: var(--text-secondary);
        }
        
        /* ----- Privacy Card ----- */
        .privacy-card {
            background: var(--bg-card);
            border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            padding: var(--spacing-xl) var(--spacing-lg);
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }
        
        .privacy-card:hover {
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
        }
        
        /* ----- Sections ----- */
        .privacy-card .section {
            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-lg);
        }
        
        .privacy-card .section:last-child {
            margin-bottom: 0;
        }
        
        .privacy-card .section .section-title {
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--purple-primary);
            margin: 0 0 6px 0;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
        }
        
        .privacy-card .section .section-title .section-number {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            width: 28px;
            height: 28px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: var(--purple-bg);
            color: var(--purple-primary);
            font-size: 0.7rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }
        
        .privacy-card .section p {
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            line-height: 1.8;
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            margin: 0 0 8px 0;
        }
        
        .privacy-card .section p:last-child {
            margin-bottom: 0;
        }
        
        .privacy-card .section ul {
            padding-left: var(--spacing-md);
            margin: 4px 0 0 0;
        }
        
        .privacy-card .section ul li {
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            line-height: 1.8;
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            margin-bottom: 4px;
        }
        
        .privacy-card .section ul li strong {
            color: var(--text-primary);
        }
        
        .privacy-card .section .contact-list {
            list-style: none;
            padding: 0;
            margin: 4px 0 0 0;
        }
        
        .privacy-card .section .contact-list li {
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            line-height: 1.8;
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            padding: 4px 0;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
        }
        
        .privacy-card .section .contact-list li i {
            color: var(--purple-primary);
            width: 20px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        
        .privacy-card .section .contact-list li a {
            color: var(--purple-primary);
            text-decoration: none;
        }
        
        .privacy-card .section .contact-list li a:hover {
            text-decoration: underline;
        }
        
        /* ----- Divider ----- */
        .privacy-card .section-divider {
            height: 1px;
            background: var(--border-color);
            margin: var(--spacing-md) 0;
        }
        
        /* ----- Back Link ----- */
        .back-link {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            text-decoration: none;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            margin-top: var(--spacing-md);
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }
        
        .back-link:hover {
            color: var(--purple-primary);
        }
        
        .back-link i {
            font-size: 0.85rem;
        }
        
        /* ----- Responsive ----- */
        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .privacy-header h1 {
                font-size: 1.5rem;
            }
            
            .privacy-card {
                padding: var(--spacing-md);
            }
            
            .privacy-card .section .section-title {
                font-size: 1rem;
            }
            
            .privacy-card .section p,
            .privacy-card .section ul li,
            .privacy-card .section .contact-list li {
                font-size: 0.88rem;
            }
        }
        
        @media (max-width: 480px) {
            .privacy-card {
                padding: var(--spacing-sm);
            }
            
            .privacy-card .section .section-title {
                font-size: 0.9rem;
            }
            
            .privacy-card .section .section-title .section-number {
                width: 22px;
                height: 22px;
                font-size: 0.6rem;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <!-- ===== HEADER ===== -->
    <%- include('partials/header', { showBack: true }) %>

    <!-- ===== MAIN CONTENT ===== -->
    <main class="main-content">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="privacy-container">

                <!-- ===== PAGE HEADER ===== -->
                <div class="privacy-header">
                    <h1><i class="fas fa-shield-alt"></i> Privacy Policy</h1>
                    <p class="last-updated">
                        <i class="far fa-calendar-alt"></i> 
                        <strong>Last Updated:</strong> August 2026
                    </p>
                </div>

                <!-- ===== PRIVACY CARD ===== -->
                <div class="privacy-card">

                    <!-- ===== SECTION 1: INTRODUCTION ===== -->
                    <div class="section">
                        <div class="section-title">
                            <span class="section-number">1</span> Introduction
                        </div>
                        <p>
                            SHINEX Learning Circle ("SLC", "we", "our", "us") is committed to protecting your privacy. 
                            This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, disclose, and safeguard your information 
                            when you visit our website and use our services.
                        </p>
                        <p>
                            By using SHINEX Learning Circle, you agree to the collection and use of information in 
                            accordance with this policy.
                        </p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="section-divider"></div>

                    <!-- ===== SECTION 2: INFORMATION WE COLLECT ===== -->
                    <div class="section">
                        <div class="section-title">
                            <span class="section-number">2</span> Information We Collect
                        </div>
                        <p>We collect the following types of information:</p>
                        <ul>
                            <li><strong>Personal Information:</strong> Name, email address, phone number, date of birth, gender, address, and Student ID.</li>
                            <li><strong>Academic Information:</strong> School, department, current level, and student status.</li>
                            <li><strong>Learning Data:</strong> Course enrollment, progress, completed classes, test scores, and points.</li>
                            <li><strong>Usage Data:</strong> Pages visited, time spent, interactions with content, and AI chat messages.</li>
                            <li><strong>Device Information:</strong> IP address, browser type, device type, and operating system.</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>

                    <div class="section-divider"></div>

                    <!-- ===== SECTION 3: HOW WE USE YOUR INFORMATION ===== -->
                    <div class="section">
                        <div class="section-title">
                            <span class="section-number">3</span> How We Use Your Information
                        </div>
                        <p>We use your information to:</p>
                        <ul>
                            <li>Create and manage your account</li>
                            <li>Provide, maintain, and improve our services</li>
                            <li>Track your learning progress and achievements</li>
                            <li>Send you email notifications about your account and courses</li>
                            <li>Respond to your inquiries and support requests</li>
                            <li>Personalize your learning experience</li>
                            <li>Analyze usage patterns to improve our platform</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>

                    <div class="section-divider"></div>

                    <!-- ===== SECTION 4: INFORMATION SHARING ===== -->
                    <div class="section">
                        <div class="section-title">
                            <span class="section-number">4</span> Information Sharing
                        </div>
                        <p>
                            We do not sell, trade, or rent your personal information to third parties. We may share your 
                            information in the following cases:
                        </p>
                        <ul>
                            <li><strong>With your consent:</strong> We may share information with your explicit permission.</li>
                            <li><strong>Service Providers:</strong> We use third-party services (e.g., email, hosting, AI) that process data on our behalf.</li>
                            <li><strong>Legal Requirements:</strong> We may disclose information if required by law or to protect our rights.</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>

                    <div class="section-divider"></div>

                    <!-- ===== SECTION 5: DATA SECURITY ===== -->
                    <div class="section">
                        <div class="section-title">
                            <span class="section-number">5</span> Data Security
                        </div>
                        <p>
                            We take data security seriously. We implement industry-standard security measures including:
                        </p>
                        <ul>
                            <li><strong>Password Hashing:</strong> All passwords are hashed using bcrypt</li>
                            <li><strong>Encryption:</strong> HTTPS encryption for all data transmission</li>
                            <li><strong>Access Control:</strong> Session management and authentication controls</li>
                            <li><strong>Monitoring:</strong> Regular security updates and monitoring</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>

                    <div class="section-divider"></div>

                    <!-- ===== SECTION 6: YOUR RIGHTS ===== -->
                    <div class="section">
                        <div class="section-title">
                            <span class="section-number">6</span> Your Rights
                        </div>
                        <p>You have the right to:</p>
                        <ul>
                            <li><strong>Access:</strong> Request a copy of your personal information</li>
                            <li><strong>Correct:</strong> Update or correct inaccurate information</li>
                            <li><strong>Delete:</strong> Delete your account and associated data</li>
                            <li><strong>Opt-out:</strong> Unsubscribe from marketing communications</li>
                            <li><strong>Portability:</strong> Request a copy of your data in a portable format</li>
                        </ul>
                        <p>
                            To exercise these rights, contact us at <strong>support@shinex.ng</strong>.
                        </p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="section-divider"></div>

                    <!-- ===== SECTION 7: COOKIES AND TRACKING ===== -->
                    <div class="section">
                        <div class="section-title">
                            <span class="section-number">7</span> Cookies and Tracking
                        </div>
                        <p>
                            We use cookies to enhance your experience on our platform. Cookies help us:
                        </p>
                        <ul>
                            <li><strong>Session Management:</strong> Remember your login session and preferences</li>
                            <li><strong>Progress Tracking:</strong> Track your learning progress</li>
                            <li><strong>Analytics:</strong> Analyze site traffic and usage patterns</li>
                        </ul>
                        <p>
                            You can manage cookie preferences in your browser settings at any time.
                        </p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="section-divider"></div>

                    <!-- ===== SECTION 8: DATA RETENTION ===== -->
                    <div class="section">
                        <div class="section-title">
                            <span class="section-number">8</span> Data Retention
                        </div>
                        <p>
                            We retain your personal information for as long as your account is active. If you delete your 
                            account, we will delete or anonymize your data within <strong>30 days</strong>, except where we are required 
                            to retain it for legal or regulatory purposes.
                        </p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="section-divider"></div>

                    <!-- ===== SECTION 9: CHILDREN'S PRIVACY ===== -->
                    <div class="section">
                        <div class="section-title">
                            <span class="section-number">9</span> Children's Privacy
                        </div>
                        <p>
                            Our services are not directed at individuals under the age of <strong>13</strong>. We do not knowingly collect 
                            personal information from children. If you are a parent or guardian and believe your child 
                            has provided us with information, please contact us immediately.
                        </p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="section-divider"></div>

                    <!-- ===== SECTION 10: CHANGES TO THIS POLICY ===== -->
                    <div class="section">
                        <div class="section-title">
                            <span class="section-number">10</span> Changes to This Policy
                        </div>
                        <p>
                            We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. We will notify you of any changes by 
                            posting the new policy on this page and updating the "Last Updated" date. We encourage you 
                            to review this policy periodically.
                        </p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="section-divider"></div>

                    <!-- ===== SECTION 11: CONTACT US ===== -->
                    <div class="section">
                        <div class="section-title">
                            <span class="section-number">11</span> Contact Us
                        </div>
                        <p>
                            If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy, please contact us:
                        </p>
                        <ul class="contact-list">
                            <li>
                                <i class="fas fa-envelope"></i>
                                <a href="mailto:shinexlearning@gmail.com">shinexlearning@gmail.com</a>
                            </li>
                            <li>
                                <i class="fas fa-phone"></i>
                                <a href="tel:+2348025052852">+234 802 505 2852</a>
                            </li>
                            <li>
                                <i class="fas fa-map-marker-alt"></i>
                                Lagos, Nigeria
                            </li>
                            <li>
                                <i class="fas fa-globe"></i>
                                <a href="https://shinex-learning.onrender.com" target="_blank">shinex-learning.onrender.com</a>
                            </li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>

                </div>

                <!-- ===== BACK LINK ===== -->
                <a href="/" class="back-link">
                    <i class="fas fa-arrow-left"></i> Back to Home
                </a>

            </div>
        </div>
    </main>

    <!-- ===== FOOTER ===== -->
    <%- include('partials/footer') %>

    <script src="/js/main.js"></script>
</body>
</html>